 ('64838ffba0e22e7be5e3bee20530dd94b9497dca04a7338250d2dac653a64dc9',
  'M1. Next, we will be talking about donations to charities that serve a variety of purposes\n'
  'such as religious activity, helping people in need, health care and medical research,\n'
  'education, arts, environment, and international aid.\n'
  'Charitable organizations include religious or non-profit organizations that help those in\n'
  'need or that serve and support the public interest. They range in size from national\n'
  'organizations like the United Way and the American Red Cross down to local community\n'
  'organizations. Political contributions are not included.\n'
  'Donations include money, assets, property or goods, whether made directly to the\n'
  'organization, through payroll deduction, or on the internet.\n'
  'Donations include any gifts of money, assets, or property or goods made directly to the\n'
  'organization, through payroll deduction, or collected by other means on behalf of the\n'
  'charity. This interview is limited to donations made during the calendar year 2012.\n'
  'During the year 2012, did (you/you or anyone in your family) donate money, assets, or\n'
  'property or goods, with a combined value of more than $25 to religious or charitable\n'
  'organizations?',
  'nominal_year_token',
  936,
  940,
  'year',
  None,
  'explicit_no_whole_domain_denotation',
  'first_question_coordinate_frequency_or_comparison_input',
  2013,
  'ER57728'),
